#X obj 668 8 flow.split;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 185 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 the object routes the input value to the first or second
outlet depending on the result of the predicate connected to the side-chain;
#X text 240 138 the predicate should accept the value and return 1
(true) or 0 (false): if 1 \, the value goes to the first outlet \,
if 0 — to the second;
#X text 240 193 the object can be used to separate a stream by any
condition \, for example to split notes into low and high registers;
